@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557
skinparam activityStartColor #163E52
skinparam activityEndColor #163E52
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M04 — Controlled page and artifact retrieval
start
:CF-M04-S01\nInitiating actor\nEmployer viewer opens an intended\nlink and requests a page, evidence\nor PDF.;
if (CF-M04-S02\nCurrent link/password context\npermits exact selected resource?) then (yes)
:CF-M04-S03\nViewer\nChoose intended page/evidence/PDF\nand applicable language;
:CF-M04-S04\nSystem\nCheck publication selection,\ndownload mode, language and\nartifact availability;
if (CF-M04-S05\nRequested selected representation\ncurrently available?) then (yes)
:CF-M04-S06\nSystem\nRecheck applicable current access\nbefore protected retrieval;
if (CF-M04-S07\nAccess still permits this resource?) then (yes)
:CF-M04-S08\nSystem\nRetrieve only intended protected\nrepresentation;
if (CF-M04-S09\nRetrieval actually completes?) then (yes)
:CF-M04-S10\nSystem\nExpose only selected content; no\nworkspace/account authority\ngranted;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M04-S11\nSystem\nReport incomplete/failed\nretrieval; no invented complete\ndelivery;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M04-S12\nSystem\nDeny protected output under\ncurrent applicable rule;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M04-S13\nSystem\nReport unavailable variant; no\nprivate or unrelated fallback;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M04-S14\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
